# Meta app

Requirements: Go 1.26.10+, Node.js/npm, and Air on PATH.

```sh
meta setup
meta dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000. Files in `public/` are available at the site root, such as `public/robots.txt` at `/robots.txt`. To build a Node-free production server:

```sh
meta build
./bin/app
```

Run the binary from this project directory so it can find `dist/client` and `public`.
